    accepts True and False as booleans (gh#phkaeser/wlmaker#508)
  * Fixes wlmbattery handling of optional sysfs files
    (gh#phkaeser/wlmaker#504)
- Rebase patches for new version
- Add sed to relax WARN_AS_ERROR in doxygen for docs
- Update libbase to libbase-54e60555cae53ad99314c7579dce1ad38373ecaa.tar.gz</comment>
